{"path":"eval/cases/cigster-118/sources/pr.json","ref":"a610a8c226a46a202300b570b1519382fa6a92cd","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":1,"text":"{"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":2,"text":"  \"html_url\": \"https://github.com/matemolnar8/cigster/pull/118\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":3,"text":"  \"number\": 118,"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":4,"text":"  \"title\": \"Add PostHog for field Web Vitals / INP\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":5,"text":"  \"body\": \"## Summary\\n- Capture field `$web_vitals` (INP, LCP, CLS, FCP) on production, grouped by route templates like `/game/$code` instead of raw join URLs.\\n- Autocapture stays on. Session replay and heatmaps stay off. Reverse proxy is `/ph` so song import at `/ingest/$id` is untouched.\\n- Local and Playwright/Docker stay off unless `VITE_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_ENABLED=true`. Netlify already has the project token on production, deploy-preview, and branch-deploy.\\n\\nCloses #104\\n\\n## Test plan\\n- [ ] Production (or this deploy preview) pageviews show `$web_vitals` with INP\\n- [ ] `/game/$code` appears as a template, not individual codes\\n- [ ] Public `/ingest/$id` still loads\\n- [ ] Playwright / Docker e2e do not load PostHog\\n- [ ] Clerk / session tokens and join codes never show up as event properties\\n\\n[Comprehende review](https://7jbadhsd.vibedrop.site)\\n\\nPosted by Cursor Grok 4.6\\n\\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":6,"text":"  \"user\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":7,"text":"    \"login\": \"matemolnar8\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":8,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":9,"text":"  \"merged_at\": \"2026-09-05T14:51:16Z\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":10,"text":"  \"merge_commit_sha\": \"03a3b9a81a46c742a8343f04606f9229b9c79995\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":11,"text":"  \"base\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":12,"text":"    \"ref\": \"main\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":13,"text":"    \"sha\": \"ffc462577ad058b71969822e1e9bb5fd9a5f4426\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":14,"text":"  },"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":15,"text":"  \"head\": {"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":16,"text":"    \"ref\": \"feat/posthog-web-vitals\","},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":17,"text":"    \"sha\": \"a4f4143110d027c74a159b2bb2fa7750efbd5560\""},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":18,"text":"  }"},{"sha":"9abe862fdc4c27327147ea229660de74b0a018d9","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1790144467,"line":19,"text":"}"}]}
